OL,3,GNEWSATeen's mother calls for taller
OL,4,Abarriers after death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a teenager who fell from
OL,7,Fa multi-storey car park has said
OL,8,Fplanned safety barriers must be high
OL,9,Fenough to properly protect people.
OL,11,FTom Combeer, 17, died after falling
OL,12,Ffrom a car park in Guildford in the
OL,13,Fearly hours of 8 March 2025.
OL,15,FCoroner Susan Ridge later warned there
OL,16,Fwere insufficient measures in place to
OL,17,Fprevent falls and suicides, and raised
OL,18,Fconcerns about public access, CCTV
OL,19,Fcoverage and barrier heights.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
